OL,5,G1600 America's Funniest Home Videos
OL,6,     FAlfonso Ribeiro presents
OL,7,     Ffamily-friendly laughs as home
OL,8,     Fvideo clips capture surprising and
OL,9,     Fmemorable moments. This time:
OL,10,     Fmagic tricks go wrong, and kids
OL,11,     Fsay the funniest things.
OL,12,G1700 Storage Wars
OL,13,     FRene's sniffed out a great locker
