OL,15,     Fand stomp on the competition to
OL,16,     Fsecure it. Kenny grafts to fire up
OL,17,     Fsome profits.
OL,18,G1730 Storage Wars
OL,19,     FBrandi and her pal have a roaring
OL,20,     Fgood time in Montebello. It's
OL,21,     Fquality over quantity for Darrell.
OL,22,     FKenny fills up his piggybank.
